# Ula'ula's roads: the long road up the island's flanks, wide and cooler than the ranches below. A vibraphone in A over an
# ukulele's loose strum and a warm pad, a bamboo flute holding long notes above it from the second part, a log drum and bass
# underneath and hand drums that come in after the first eight bars; at night a celesta, a harp and an ocarina.
# Original composition for this game, in the modern sound.
title Ula'ula Road
tempo 104
meter 4/4
reverb 0.32
nighttempo 0.9
room hall 2.2

